{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635500/extras/8d2678565e0a3d7f008b9b226d6fa48f.avif?t=1755596894\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Erika learns this from a mysterious stranger named Airic O 'Fory. He warns her and her future companions of another shadow crusade, an approaching threat that took countless lives in Solitas 24 years ago. Only the descendants of the clans of elements have the power to avert it - Descendants like Erika. And so she embarks on a journey into the unknown, which will lead her through all of Solitas and perhaps even beyond.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635500/extras/f84d83dd3661c3ad0e61a3d9e5439fca.webp?t=1755596894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635500/extras/f84d83dd3661c3ad0e61a3d9e5439fca.poster.avif?t=1755596894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span><br>Join Erika on her mission! Find all those who have been chosen to walk this path with her and awaken their elemental powers. Not only do they open up unique possibilities in combat, they also help you to overcome various obstacles along the way. Defeat fearsome monsters, treacherous adversaries - and sometimes Erika's own fears.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635500/extras/4d923d624f8f349fc693538ca2c099a8.webp?t=1755596894\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1635500/extras/4d923d624f8f349fc693538ca2c099a8.poster.avif?t=1755596894\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=100 /></picture></span><br>On their way, Erika, Lia, Maline and Karen meet a variety of different personalities. Anyone could steer the story in a new direction. Which, however, remains to be seen.<h2 class=\"bb_t